350 0 obj
  << /ActualText (We believe great coffee is about more than what\031s in the cup\056 It\031s about the care behind every detail\054 the people you share it with\054 and the little moments that make an ordinary day feel special\056\n\nFrom thoughtfully sourced beans to a welcoming space\054 everything we do is made with intention\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 351 0 R
     /Pg 338 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
