356 0 obj
  << /ActualText (What started with a simple love for good coffee became a place we wanted to share with others\056\n\nWe wanted to create a coffee shop that felt welcoming from the moment you walked through the door \024 somewhere you could grab your morning coffee\054 settle in for a quiet afternoon\054 or meet a friend and lose track of time\056\n\nWe work with carefully selected beans\054 thoughtful ingredients\054 and people who genuinely care about what they create\056 Every cup is a little reminder that good things are worth taking the time to do properly\056)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 357 0 R
     /Pg 338 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
